---
import SolutionPage from '../../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Grounding"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Humans evolved in constant electrical contact with the earth. Modern life has eliminated it entirely — and the biology notices."
  slug="environment-grounding"
  canonicalPath="/solutions/environment/grounding"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why This Matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Grounding (earthing) transfers free electrons from the earth's surface into the body, where they act as natural antioxidants neutralizing positively-charged free radicals that drive inflammation and oxidative stress</li>
    <li>For virtually all of human history this contact was continuous — modern life has eliminated it almost entirely via rubber soles, elevated structures, and synthetic flooring</li>
    <li>Peer-reviewed research has documented measurable effects on inflammatory markers, cortisol rhythm, wound healing rate, and sleep quality — the intervention is real, and the barrier is only inconvenience</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Featured Products — E-Commerce Hero ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Featured Products</h2>
  <p>Protocol-matched grounding products for daily and sleep use. Affiliate relationships disclosed below.</p>
  <div class="product-grid">
    <div class="product-card">
