      <p class="product-why">Delivers grounding during work hours without changing your desk routine — barefoot under your desk.</p>
      <p>Large-format conductive floor mat. Connects to standard ground outlet. No outdoor access required.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=grounding-floor-mat -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Grounding Floor Mat" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Grounding Fitted Sheet</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Highest-surface-area grounding solution — full-body contact throughout the sleep period.</p>
      <p>Silver-thread conductive fitted sheet. For those who want maximum contact area during sleep without a mat layer.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=grounding-fitted-sheet -->
