      <p>Adhesive conductive patches for feet, wrists, or areas of chronic inflammation. Portable grounding on the go.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=grounding-patches -->
